{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"dfd-external-entity","text":"外部实体 External Entity 是系统边界之外与系统交换数据的人、组织或其他系统，命名通常使用名词。","source":"licensed-dfd-notes","kind":"concept","date":"2026-01-10","quality":1.0,"metadata":{"language":"zh-en"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"dfd-process","text":"处理 Process 将输入数据转换为输出数据，应使用动宾短语命名，并且必须至少有一个输入和一个输出。","source":"licensed-dfd-notes","kind":"concept","date":"2026-01-10","quality":1.0,"metadata":{"language":"zh-en"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"dfd-data-flow","text":"数据流 Data Flow 表示数据在实体、处理和数据存储之间的移动，不表示控制信号或执行顺序。","source":"licensed-dfd-notes","kind":"concept","date":"2026-01-10","quality":1.0,"metadata":{"language":"zh-en"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"dfd-data-store","text":"数据存储 Data Store 表示系统需要保留的数据集合，例如订单库；不能直接与外部实体交换数据。","source":"licensed-dfd-notes","kind":"concept","date":"2026-01-10","quality":1.0,"metadata":{"language":"zh-en"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"dfd-leveling","text":"DFD 分层从上下文图逐层分解处理。父图与子图之间应维持接口平衡，并保留稳定的父子关系。","source":"licensed-dfd-notes","kind":"rule","date":"2026-02-01","quality":0.95,"metadata":{"language":"zh"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"dfd-balance","text":"DFD balance rule 平衡原则要求子图的输入输出数据流与父图中被分解处理的输入输出一致，新增内部流不违反平衡。","source":"licensed-dfd-notes","kind":"rule","date":"2026-02-01","quality":1.0,"metadata":{"language":"zh-en"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"software-cohesion","text":"Cohesion 内聚描述模块内部职责的关联程度。高内聚通常与低耦合共同用于改善软件设计。","source":"desensitized-software-notes","kind":"theory","date":"2026-03-15","quality":0.9,"metadata":{"language":"en-zh"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"payment-example","text":"支付订单案例包含客户外部实体、创建订单处理、支付处理、订单数据存储以及订单状态数据流。","source":"desensitized-examples","kind":"example","date":"2026-04-20","quality":0.85,"metadata":{"language":"zh"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"accounting-balance","text":"会计资产负债表的 balance 表示借贷或资产负债平衡，与数据流图的父子图接口无关。","source":"hard-negative-notes","kind":"theory","date":"2025-12-01","quality":0.7,"metadata":{"language":"zh-en"}}
{"dataset_version":"1.0.0","id":"weather-flow","text":"天气系统中的气流描述空气移动和气压变化，不是软件数据流图中的 Data Flow。","source":"hard-negative-notes","kind":"theory","date":"2025-12-01","quality":0.7,"metadata":{"language":"zh"}}
